{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover the truth, rewrite the past, and finds out What killed us all?<br><br>What Killed Us All?</strong> is a narrative-driven adventure set on a hauntingly beautiful resort island in Malaysia. You play as a ghost who awakens one week before her tragic death, given a final chance to uncover the truth. Will you change fate or let history repeat itself?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two Worlds, One Story</strong> \u2013 Shift between past and present, piecing together fragments of truth across life and death.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choices That Matter</strong> \u2013 Your actions create ripple effects, leading to multiple endings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Friends and Foe\u00a0</strong>\u2013 Meet a diverse group of characters, each with layered histories and secrets that slowly intertwine.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Inspired by Southeast Asia</strong> \u2013 Characters, stories, and environments are rooted in Southeast Asian culture, adding authenticity and depth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Art Style</strong> \u2013 A unique \u201cpaper theater\u201d presentation that brings the mystery to life.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3866120?t=1756283350","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866120/c58acf67aa7df01f2b75f14906e8261961895b46/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756283350","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866120/476fd688159c7686490042696240cc255f443e83/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756283350","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866120/476fd688159c7686490042696240cc255f443e83/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756283350","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"d